<div class="content">
  <h2 class="title">当前打印机正处于小票模式！</h2>
  <p>请按如下步骤更换为标签模式！</p>
  <ol>
    <li>打开纸仓盖，更换为标签打印纸！</li>
    <li>关闭纸仓盖！</li>
    <li>
      <% if @printer.is_a? Print::MqttPrinter %>
        <%=
          button_to(
            { controller: 'mqtt_printers', action: 'dev_type', id: @printer.id },
            params: { dev_type: 'cpcl' },
            class: 'button is-rounded is-primary'
          ) do
        %>
          <%= svg_tag 'print' %>
          <span>切换为 CPCL</span>
        <% end %>
      <% else %>
        <%=
          button_to(
            { controller: 'bluetooth_printers', action: 'dev_type', id: @printer.id },
            params: { dev_type: 'cpcl' },
            class: 'button is-rounded is-primary'
          ) do
        %>
          <%= svg_tag 'print' %>
          <span>切换为 CPCL</span>
        <% end %>
      <% end %>
    </li>
    <li>
      <%=
        button_to(
          { action: 'inner' },
          params: params.permit(:gid, :aim, :dev_type),
          disabled: true,
          id: 'inner-print-button',
          class: 'button is-rounded is-primary'
        ) do
      %>
        <span>打印</span>
      <% end %>
    </li>
  </ol>
</div>
